+// the input side, which has INPUT{0,1,2}_DIMS_ORDER), so for them a non-default output order is
+// silently ignored and the result lands in the wrong place. The fusion is therefore restricted to
+// SDPAs that will run on the micro kernel -- see the guards in the callback below.
